  },
  "algorithms": [
    {
      "html": "Next, the combined rule set is prepared\n          for evaluation with the following steps.",
      "rationale": "check",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "Check that each rule is a <a data-link-type=\"dfn|abstract-op\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/data-shapes/sparql12-rl/#dfn-well-formed-rule\" class=\"internalDFN\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-well-formed-rule-4\">well-formed rule</a>, as described in\n            <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/data-shapes/sparql12-rl/#wellformed\" class=\"sectionRef sec-ref\"><bdi class=\"secno\">4.2 </bdi>Well-formedness Conditions</a>."
        },
        {
          "html": "Calculate the <a data-link-type=\"dfn|abstract-op\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/data-shapes/sparql12-rl/#dfn-dependency-graph\" class=\"internalDFN\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-dependency-graph-10\">dependency graph</a>, as described in\n            <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/data-shapes/sparql12-rl/#dependency-graph-construction-algorithm\" class=\"sectionRef sec-ref\"><bdi class=\"secno\">4.3.2 </bdi>Dependency Graph Algorithm</a>."
        },
        {
          "html": "Calculate a <a data-link-type=\"dfn|abstract-op\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/data-shapes/sparql12-rl/#dfn-stratification\" class=\"internalDFN\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-stratification-13\">stratification</a> of the combined rule set, as described in\n            <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/data-shapes/sparql12-rl/#stratification\" class=\"sectionRef sec-ref\"><bdi class=\"secno\">4.4 </bdi>Stratification</a>.\n            <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/data-shapes/sparql12-rl/#stratification-algorithm\" class=\"sectionRef sec-ref\"><bdi class=\"secno\">4.4.2 </bdi>Stratification Algorithm</a>\n            gives one way to calculate a <a data-link-type=\"dfn|abstract-op\" href=\"https://w3c.github.io/data-shapes/sparql12-rl/#dfn-stratification\" class=\"internalDFN\" id=\"ref-for-dfn-stratification-14\">stratification</a>."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}